### Conserva las cookies y obtiene el token antes de modificar datos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/csrf

> {% client.global.set("csrf", response.body.token); %}

### Catálogo original
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### Agregar al shopping_cart original
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cart/items
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId":1,"quantity":2}

### Consultar carrito
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cart

### Pago simulado; devuelve recibo sin persistir pedido
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cart/checkout
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"method":"EFECTIVO"}
